  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I never thought we'd need something like this, but after spending some time favoriting pretty and good worlds over the last few days, you start to realize just how many fantastic places there are on vrchat. I'm definitely in need of additional favorites now as 100 per list is not enough anymore! I could fill out my other lists but i'm trying to keep them sorted for different occasions, so i'd like to not have to do that!\n\nIf we could get a bump from 4 lists and 100 favorites per list, to like 5 lists and 200 favorites, that'd be really awesome",
